"description":"This app is dedicated to seamless cross‑device migration, backup, and everyday file transfer for diverse content on mobile phones. It supports critical data types including photos, videos, contacts, calendar events, documents and more. By leveraging technical innovations to overcome limitations of conventional transfer solutions, we deliver a secure, high‑speed, and highly‑compatible solution for data movement across devices.\n【Multi‑Format Intelligent Support】\nFully compatible with dozens of file formats: images (JPEG / PNG / HEIC / RAW), videos (MP4 / MOV / AVI / H.264), structured data (vCard contacts / iCal calendars), and documents (PDF / DOCX / XLSX / PPTX / ZIP, etc.). It automatically adapts to the target device’s operating environment to guarantee data integrity.\n【Smart Batch Processing】\nMulti‑dimensional batch operations are supported. Real‑time progress and statistics are displayed during transfer.\n【QR‑Code Pairing】\nAdopting universal QR‑code connection technology for zero‑setup fast device pairing. The sender generates a dynamic QR code; the receiver scans it with the system camera to establish a private transfer channel.\n【Local Wi‑Fi Acceleration】\nAll data is transmitted over local Wi‑Fi via direct peer‑to‑peer mobile connection. Taking full advantage of high‑speed local networks, transfers avoid cloud buffering and server relaying. No third‑party platform is involved throughout the process to safeguard data security and privacy.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSubscription Terms\nPayment: Payment will be charged to your iTunes account upon purchase confirmation.\nAuto‑Renewal: Your iTunes account will be charged for renewal within 24‑hours prior to the end of each subscription period, and the subscription term will be extended accordingly.\nCancel Auto‑Renewal: To turn off auto‑renewal, please go to Settings → [Your Apple ID] → Subscriptions on your device and cancel at least 24‑hours before the end of the current billing cycle.\nPrivacy Polic